{
    "title": "Ding Top-up: Mobile Recharge",
    "description": "With the Ding app, you can top-up any number, anywhere, easily. As the world\u2019s leading mobile recharge service, we\u2019ll deliver your top in 3 seconds. We love keeping you and your loved ones connected. We\u2019ve also got some of your favourite gift cards here, for you to choose. Whether it\u2019s for yourself, or you want to gift that special someone, with the gift of choice. We\u2019ve got it all for you, right here.\r\n\r\nIt's the little things that really matter. Whether it's a quick \"\"Hello\"\", or a video call to wish them a Happy Birthday, every moment counts. Since 2006, we've been helping people send top-ups safely and securely and we've sent over 500 million top-ups in more than 150 countries.\r\n\r\nWhether you call it top-up, recharge, refill, airtime, load, credit, or something else, you can send it on the Ding app. Our app is available in 7 supported languages. You can download and use the Ding recharge app in English, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Italian, German, or Russian.\r\n\r\nRecharge 150+ countries\r\n\r\nAdd credit to your own phone or send it to your friend's and family's prepaid phones around the world. You can send airtime recharge to countries including Cuba, Jamaica, Philippines, Haiti, India, Mexico, Afghanistan, Ghana, Saudi Arabia, Dominican Republic, USA, Nepal and more.\r\n\r\nThe #1 international mobile top-up app\r\n\r\nThe fastest way to send top-up: delivered in 3 seconds\r\n\r\n24/7 multilingual customer support\r\n\r\n100% secure online transactions processed by our dedicated fraud team\r\n\r\nExclusive Ding discounts and promotions\r\n\r\nOver 1 million downloads\r\n\r\nHow to send top-up\r\nDownload the Ding app and follow three easy steps to recharge your own phone or send mobile phone credit to a loved one anywhere in the world\r\n\r\nChoose an amount of top-up to send\r\n\r\nEnter the number you want to recharge\r\n\r\nAdd your details & confirm\r\n\r\nWe'll do the rest; it really is that simple. In 3 seconds, the top-up will be delivered\r\n\r\nGet the following and more with the Ding app:\r\n\r\nValue for money\r\n\r\nChoose from our range of data plans and bundles available from over 850 operators, to find what suits you best. You\u2019ll also access exclusive in-app promotions and discounts.\r\n\r\nAlready have an account?\r\nIf you already have a Ding account, login with your existing account and all your details and transaction history will follow you over. Easily send top-up, set auto top-up, or request top-up in app. If you haven't got your Ding account set up yet, don't worry it's just as simple.\r\n\r\nPayment Methods\r\nWe accept all major payment methods, such as Visa, MasterCard, American Express, PayPal, Apple Pay and more. Your details are protected with Trustwave 128-bit SSL encryption and monitored by our internal fraud team.\r\n\r\nScheduled top-up\r\nTo avoid you or a loved one running out of credit, our schedule top-up feature helps you top-up right when you need to. You can choose to schedule auto top-up every 7, 14, 28, or 30 days. any discounts available, are automatically applied to auto top-ups.\r\n\r\nMore than 600 mobile networks\r\n\r\nWe work with mobile carriers around the world to deliver your international mobile recharge in seconds. Choose from networks such as: Cubacel, Digicel, Nauta, Claro, Flow/Lime, Smart, Globe, Lycamobile, MTN, Movistar, Ooredoo, Orange, Airtel, Tigo, Virgin Mobile, Vodafone, Zain, AT&T, Telcel and many more.\r\n\r\nSo why wait any longer? Get the Ding app now for free and send a little joy so they know you're thinking of them.",
    "descriptionHTML": "With the Ding app, you can top-up any number, anywhere, easily. As the world\u2019s leading mobile recharge service, we\u2019ll deliver your top in 3 seconds. We love keeping you and your loved ones connected. We\u2019ve also got some of your favourite gift cards here, for you to choose. Whether it\u2019s for yourself, or you want to gift that special someone, with the gift of choice. We\u2019ve got it all for you, right here.<br><br>It&#39;s the little things that really matter. Whether it&#39;s a quick &quot;&quot;Hello&quot;&quot;, or a video call to wish them a Happy Birthday, every moment counts. Since 2006, we&#39;ve been helping people send top-ups safely and securely and we&#39;ve sent over 500 million top-ups in more than 150 countries.<br><br>Whether you call it top-up, recharge, refill, airtime, load, credit, or something else, you can send it on the Ding app. Our app is available in 7 supported languages. You can download and use the Ding recharge app in English, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Italian, German, or Russian.<br><br>Recharge 150+ countries<br><br>Add credit to your own phone or send it to your friend&#39;s and family&#39;s prepaid phones around the world. You can send airtime recharge to countries including Cuba, Jamaica, Philippines, Haiti, India, Mexico, Afghanistan, Ghana, Saudi Arabia, Dominican Republic, USA, Nepal and more.<br><br>The #1 international mobile top-up app<br><br>The fastest way to send top-up: delivered in 3 seconds<br><br>24/7 multilingual customer support<br><br>100% secure online transactions processed by our dedicated fraud team<br><br>Exclusive Ding discounts and promotions<br><br>Over 1 million downloads<br><br>How to send top-up<br>Download the Ding app and follow three easy steps to recharge your own phone or send mobile phone credit to a loved one anywhere in the world<br><br>Choose an amount of top-up to send<br><br>Enter the number you want to recharge<br><br>Add your details &amp; confirm<br><br>We&#39;ll do the rest; it really is that simple. In 3 seconds, the top-up will be delivered<br><br>Get the following and more with the Ding app:<br><br>Value for money<br><br>Choose from our range of data plans and bundles available from over 850 operators, to find what suits you best. You\u2019ll also access exclusive in-app promotions and discounts.<br><br>Already have an account?<br>If you already have a Ding account, login with your existing account and all your details and transaction history will follow you over. Easily send top-up, set auto top-up, or request top-up in app. If you haven&#39;t got your Ding account set up yet, don&#39;t worry it&#39;s just as simple.<br><br>Payment Methods<br>We accept all major payment methods, such as Visa, MasterCard, American Express, PayPal, Apple Pay and more. Your details are protected with Trustwave 128-bit SSL encryption and monitored by our internal fraud team.<br><br>Scheduled top-up<br>To avoid you or a loved one running out of credit, our schedule top-up feature helps you top-up right when you need to. You can choose to schedule auto top-up every 7, 14, 28, or 30 days. any discounts available, are automatically applied to auto top-ups.<br><br>More than 600 mobile networks<br><br>We work with mobile carriers around the world to deliver your international mobile recharge in seconds. Choose from networks such as: Cubacel, Digicel, Nauta, Claro, Flow/Lime, Smart, Globe, Lycamobile, MTN, Movistar, Ooredoo, Orange, Airtel, Tigo, Virgin Mobile, Vodafone, Zain, AT&amp;T, Telcel and many more.<br><br>So why wait any longer? Get the Ding app now for free and send a little joy so they know you&#39;re thinking of them.",
